<title>POLAND: KOMUNALNY OCT NET DOWN TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</title>
<headline>KOMUNALNY OCT NET DOWN TO PLN 0.5 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  0.52 vs    0.57</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    1.15 vs    0.64</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		  1.63 vs    1.01</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	 3.16 vs    1.84</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.79 vs    4.73</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    9.60 vs    6.45</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 13.69 vs   10.19</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	28.30 vs   16.62</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Komunalny w Gdyni</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
